<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>03 · SECURITY & GOVERNANCE</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            五层防线：每一层都能打开看、按企业需要改
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#D6E4F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13, gap: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 30, background: '#93C5FD' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 300 }}>身份与授权</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    密码 / LDAP / SSO-OIDC / 邀请码，JWT 全站校验，按行隔离用户数据
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13, gap: 16, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0891B2', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 30, background: '#C7D6F5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 300 }}>命令守卫</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    20 条内建危险命令规则，可选拦截、告警或转人工审批，规则可自定义
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13, gap: 16, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0891B2', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 30, background: '#C7D6F5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 300 }}>文件系统沙箱</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    按操作与路径配置允许 / 拒绝，默认拦截 /etc、/root、.env、密钥与云凭证
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13, gap: 16, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0891B2', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 30, background: '#C7D6F5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 300 }}>数据与出站</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    四种脱敏策略作用于输入输出与工具结果，出站请求做 SSRF 校验
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#FFF7E9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#F5D9A4', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13, gap: 16, marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>05</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 30, background: '#F5D9A4' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 300 }}>审计与备份</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#92400E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    工具调用全量记入轨迹账本，支持自动备份与一键恢复
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 18, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                安全不是一句承诺：这五层都是配置文件里看得见、改得动、有日志可查的具体机制。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
